{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>After the number of days.</b> Which they spent prolonging your commission to see whether it was possible to conquer it." "<b>A day for a year.</b> The ninth of Av of each year, as explained in Ta'anit (Ta'anit 30a)." "<b>My rejection.</b> You will recognize how evil is the frustration of My purpose through your turning away from it, as it says (Numbers 14:43): וּנְפַלְתֶּם בַּחֶרֶב כִּי עַל כֵּן שַׁבְתֶּם מֵאַחֲרֵי ה׳."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:54.541646158Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}